[Unit]
Description=Application filesystem ready at the app mount point
# passive synchronization point decoupling the application from how the
# app filesystem is delivered: the mode-specific mount provider and the
# boot-time update bookkeeping (fus-update-confirm.service) order Before=
# this target, so reaching it means the app filesystem is ready and
# pending update state is reconciled. an application orders
# After=/Requires= this target and stays mode-agnostic.
